  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Second Infrastructure Asset Management Project</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project&#x2019;s development objectives are to: (i) enhance the economic, environmental and social sustainabilityof transport and coastal infrastructure assets; and (ii) manage those assets and natural resources and respond to nationalemergencies, through an effective partnership with private sector stakeholders.</narrative>
  </description>
