  <result aggregation-status="0" type="1">
   <title>
    <narrative xml:lang="EN">Intermediate Results Indicator</narrative>
   </title>
   <indicator ascending="1" measure="2">
    <title>
     <narrative xml:lang="EN">Percentage of key technical and managerial positions filled at LTA</narrative>
    </title>
    <baseline iso-date="2004-01-21" value="60.00" year="2004">
     <comment>
      <narrative xml:lang="EN"></narrative>
     </comment>
    </baseline>
    <period>
     <period-start iso-date="2004-01-21"></period-start>
     <period-end iso-date="2014-06-30"></period-end>
     <target value="100.00"></target>
     <actual value="79.00">
      <comment>
       <narrative xml:lang="EN">Given the limited capacity in Samoa and the difficulty in retaining qualified staff (due to low civil servant salaries),  the endtarget was optimistic.  However, despite these challenges, the quality of LTA staff would appear to be on the rise.  For the firsttime in several years, a PMU has been formed to manage two new road sector projects (CRWCR and ERAP) that is comprised entirely ofLTAstaff.</narrative>
      </comment>
     </actual>
    </period>
   </indicator>
  </result>
  <result aggregation-status="0" type="2">
   <title>
    <narrative xml:lang="EN">PDO Indicator</narrative>
   </title>
   <indicator ascending="1" measure="5">
    <title>
     <narrative xml:lang="EN">Reformed management structures in place for Land Transport</narrative>
    </title>
    <baseline iso-date="2004-01-21" value="No" year="2004">
     <comment>
      <narrative xml:lang="EN"></narrative>
     </comment>
    </baseline>
    <period>
     <period-start iso-date="2004-01-21"></period-start>
     <period-end iso-date="2014-06-30"></period-end>
     <target value="Yes">
      <comment>
       <narrative xml:lang="EN">SIAM-2 helped to consolidate the merger of land transport and road asset management functions within the LTA, which becamefunctional in 2005.  Technical support was provided to LTA to strengthen how it procured and managed maintenance contracts with theprivate sector, and to monitor the condition of road assets.</narrative>
      </comment>
     </target>
     <actual value="Yes">
      <comment>
       <narrative xml:lang="EN">Target originally achieved in2010 and maintainedthereafter.</narrative>
      </comment>
     </actual>
    </period>
   </indicator>
  </result>
